## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for charity fundraisers in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: a wireless microphone for the emcee, PA sound for the room, and staging for a live auction. Since 1996 we have delivered, installed and tested the equipment ourselves, keeping your evening on schedule.

