## Speeches and the Auction: Microphones and Staging

For an emcee, speeches or a toast, our wireless handheld microphone lets a speaker move away from the podium. For a live auction, the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/)'s optional staging and methacrylate lectern give the auctioneer a real stage for the room's biggest moment, and the 60 inch LED display can show the current bid or a donor recognition slide.

